<!--Post: 13362--><!--Time: 1115142033-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13362"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 10:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Fox, so very true.  There really is no escape for him ...anywhere.  I pray that he definitely ends up on the prison road.  He probably won&#39;t last long on the inside...ah the speculations we could all come up with in regard to the future of this monster inside this shell of a human being.  He is definitely now receiving the &#34;notariety he has always craved&#34;....he is now going to milk the &#34;system&#34; - he has no future...the way the @&#42;&#42; probably looks at it - is at least he will have a bed and food...but...in prison...I just don&#39;t think he will survive long on the inside - <!--/Text--></td></tr>
