<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13372"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 4:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve h <BR> <BR>I fear my &#34;numbness of brain&#34; my neanderthal ways may have rubbed off on you !  The thinking man&#39;s thinking man, you have a responsibility as the sound and sane voice of reason aka the last bastian of civilized humanity.  .  .   <BR> <BR>But if you change your mind you are always welcome around the old cavefire.  .  .  <BR> <BR>Maybe we could rent the UFC Octagon in Vegas: &#34;Let&#39;s get it on !&#34;  .  .  .  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
