<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13377"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 5:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve - as Susan Peters said his lawyers told the media that demon @&#42;&#42; is in complete control. The only regard he has is for himself only. To stand in front of a Judge mute, still exerts power and control out of sheer spite. The reason I say spite is primarily because spite is what all of this is about. It&#39;s the failure of the psych exam that caused demon @&#42;&#42; to start mocking the WPD. This piece of garbage knows exactly what he is doing.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
