</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 11:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think his standing mute is his way of refusing to participate...passive resistance. KSN is running specials after the the late news and they have a letter from Denny to a &#40;so far un-named&#41; family member, which they are &#39;sharing&#39; in chunks to get a weeks worth of ratings out of it. &#40;HOME-LINKS-KSN&#41;. He&#39;s writing poems again, and if there was any doubts that he IS THE BTK, his prose and poetry should put them to rest. <BR> <BR>Nola needs to add 1 more count to her indictment for murder of the English language.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
